        "jsCode": "const upstream = $input.first().json;\nconst context = $('Extract Parent Attributes').first().json;\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  decision: 'CHECKED',\n  mode: 'create',\n  request_id: context.request_id,\n  parent_sku: context.parent_sku,\n  attributes_sent: context.attributes,\n  amazon_response: upstream,\n  reminder: 'A clean ACCEPTED response here does NOT confirm the parent was actually created - a documented, if old (2023), report describes exactly this operation returning ACCEPTED while creating nothing. Call this same workflow again with action=verify, a few minutes from now, to check what is actually true.'\n}}];"
